//- 
    mixin consumed by main-layout.pug to render footer buttons in the game pages.
    The mixin takes three parameters: shuffle, clear, and submit, which are the IDs for the respective buttons. This allows each game page to specify its own button IDs for event handling.
    It assigns an ID to each game's respective buttons so that the buttons can be targeted for event listeners in the client-side JavaScript for each game.
mixin footerBtn(shuffle, clear, submit)
    .game-block.footer-btns-block
        .footer-btns
            button.footer-btn.footer-btn-1(id=shuffle) SHUFFLE
            button.footer-btn.footer-btn-2(id=clear) DEL / CLEAR
            button.footer-btn.footer-btn-3(id=submit) SUBMIT

